# Declaration only (spec 21 section 6, spec 25): user.profile keeps its own patterns and operations. This schema serves the dice, the example chips and the action buttons (std.sample):
# the whole sentences the dice may say are read from the world's own state by the hook `sampleKnowledge` of ops.mjs (declaredExecutor). Nothing is generated except schema.declared.mjs.
@profile acts.schema
    noun="question"
    declare=yes
    doc="The profile: what the user may ask the profile world (read-only requests)."
    acts=make

@profile.question acts.kind
    know=questions:*
    dice.not=make
    plural=questions
